@startuml d6-swim-state
' D6 (design, state): what one member believes about another member in SWIM. Owner: Kushagra.
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

[*] --> Alive : seed, Join, or\nupdate from gossip
Alive --> Suspect : no ack to direct ping\nand k indirect pings,\nor suspect(i >= inc) heard
Suspect --> Alive : alive(i > inc) heard\n(member refuted)
Suspect --> Dead : suspect timeout,\nor dead(i >= inc) heard
Alive --> Dead : dead(i >= inc) heard
Dead --> Alive : alive(i > inc) heard\n(member restarted)
Dead : leader releases its leases
@enduml
